Subject: [PATCH] [261/275] USB: isp1760: Implement solution for erratum 2
Message-Id: <20110330210828.6FFC13E1A05@tassilo.jf.intel.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Mar 2011 14:08:28 -0700 (PDT)
Sender: linux-kernel-owner@vger.kernel.org
